invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_verify.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the host verifier multiplies G by u2 and the key by u1, so no
  signature verifies. bin/p384_equiv_test requires p384.c's verdict,
  and 1, on the signatures it builds.

--- old
    p384_wide_double_mul(&sum, u1, u2, &q);
--- new
    p384_wide_double_mul(&sum, u2, u1, &q);
